  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f69c6b1f1e1fc2c4b9a85c7696ada520, type: 3}
  m_Name: BeforeTutor4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogSO
  replics:
  - 'Vincent, how are you? '
  - "I\u2019m busy. Did you forget they told us to use our real names as little as
    possible?"
  - "There\u2019s no one else here right now. Besides, you\u2019re my brother."
  - " The only thing I\u2019m grateful to our parents for is giving us nice names.
    Don\u2019t you think so?"
  - "Though, fair\u2014how could they give \u201Ccombat projects\u201D names that
    aren\u2019t aesthetically pleasing? He-he-he\u2026."
  - "I don\u2019t like them."
  - Why?...
  - "Because \u201CVincent\u201D is tied to you. And anything tied to you makes me
    uncomfortable and irritated."
  - Go do something useful and stop bothering me.
  - "Fine\u2026 I just hope one day you\u2019ll stop hating me for the fact that
    thanks to me you\u2019re not some corporate battle puppet or merchandise."
  - Want me to repeat it word for word?
  - ' G-e-t. O-u-t. '
  - D-i-s-a-p-p-e-a-r.
  - "Shame no one\u2019s killed you on a mission yet \u2014 maybe then you\u2019d
    finally stop haunting me."
  - Huh? Fine! Got it.
